The protected host checkout deliberately remains on the pre-transition commit.
This wrapper reads the root-controlled publication-base pin, proves every base
rotation back to the exact reviewed incident anchor, materializes only the
active analyzer runtime paths with ``git archive``, and never checks out or
updates a Git ref.
